flowchart TD
    A[Work request] --> B[resolve: role -> tier ladder]
    B --> C{Tier 0 eligible?}
    C -->|yes| D[Route: model + effort + transport]
    C -->|hard constraint fails| E[Next tier / disclosed substitute]
    D --> F[admit: budget forecast vs meters]
    F -->|blocked| G[Refuse before spend]
    F -->|admitted| H[claim-dispatch: one-way claim]
    H --> I[Carrier runs work]
    I --> J[reconcile: imported receipt only]
    J --> K[Run log: route + tier + cost + outcome]
